---

sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor Expert
  actor Manager as L&D Manager
  participant Service as CertificateAuthoringService
  participant PG as PostgreSQL authoring store
  participant Catalog as Neo4j certificate catalog
  Expert->>Service: Import or select exact Skill and knowledge rows
  Service->>PG: Retain owned drafts, batch receipt and events
  Expert->>Service: Submit expected draft revision
  Service->>PG: SUBMITTED and staff in-app review notification
  Manager->>Service: View exact revision, then approve or reject
  Service->>PG: Viewed acknowledgement and retained decision
  opt Approved: PUBLISHING
    Service->>Service: Background publishOne claims next eligible row
    Service->>Catalog: Validate and publish with stable command identity
    Catalog-->>Service: Published definition ID/version
    Service->>PG: PUBLISHED event and author in-app notification
  end
  Note over Manager,PG: Reject requires a reason; approval reason is optional
  Note over Service,Catalog: Retryable publication; failure stays visible as PUBLISH_FAILED
  Note over Expert,Catalog: Existing pathways retain pinned A; new pathways use B after publication
